# Toasts after Save, Export and Save, at 640x400 CSS px at 1x. The
# stack sits 16 px from the bottom right, 260 px wide; toasts are 44 px
# tall with 8 px between, filling y 236..280, 288..332 and 340..384,
# x 364..624, over the canvas region. Dismissing is checked in
# crates/demos/tests/toasts.rs: these clicks are all hit against the
# frame before them, so none can reach a toast another click raised.
click 530 21
click 598 21
click 530 21
pixel 4 60 #2b2b2b          canvas region, left of the stack
pixel 380 220 #2b2b2b       canvas region, above the stack
pixel 380 258 #f1f3f5       the first toast, over the canvas
pixel 380 302 #f1f3f5       the second
pixel 380 362 #f1f3f5       the third
pixel 366 362 #2e7d32       a toast's left border
ink 380 345 520 380 #f1f3f5 the third toast's message is drawn

# A phone: the bar's buttons end 8 px from the right as before (Save
# about x 253..308, Export 316..382); the stack is x 114..374, its one
# toast y 740..784.
at 390x800
click 280 21
pixel 130 762 #f1f3f5       the toast, over the canvas
pixel 116 762 #2e7d32       its left border
pixel 130 720 #2b2b2b       canvas above it
